## Evolutionary Physics Engine

### 1. Core idea

Instead of evolving *states* under fixed laws only, you also evolve the **laws**:

Each candidate universe has:

- a set of operator definitions (parameters, exponents, couplings)
- a meta-equation configuration (weights, factors)
- possibly a slightly different C_MB-derived law profile

You:

1. run them  
2. score them  
3. select the best  
4. mutate their laws  
5. repeat  

So you get an **evolutionary loop over laws**, not just over initial conditions.

